                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4ef34019-a642-3b51-9aac-323c2c74ba5e",
                        "entry_id": "03cac131-1d4c-365f-9a15-d187443eefda",
                        "glosses": [
                            "die Zahl 10¹⁰⁰, was einer 1 mit 100 Nullen entspricht"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "meist ohne erkennbares Geschlecht"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0cf7971-6625-437c-bd17-4cea96b3fe34",
                                "sense_id": "4ef34019-a642-3b51-9aac-323c2c74ba5e",
                                "text": "Ein Googol ist ausgeschrieben 10 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0ebdb7d-511d-4d7d-acba-bf9453fd41fc",
                                "sense_id": "4ef34019-a642-3b51-9aac-323c2c74ba5e",
                                "text": "„Der Name unseres Suchwerkzeugs leitet sich von ‚Googol‘ ab, eine von Edward Kasner und James Newman in ihrem Buch ‚Mathematics and the Imagination‘ 1940 eingeführte Bezeichnung für die Zahl zehn hoch einhundert, also eine 1, gefolgt von 100 Nullen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "283e4bf6-93de-4d15-a030-9b6838231dac",
                                "sense_id": "4ef34019-a642-3b51-9aac-323c2c74ba5e",
                                "text": "Der Junge nannte sie Googol, und Kasner machte diesen neuen Zahlennamen sehr erfolgreich der Öffentlichkeit bekannt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18e5074b-ece5-4aa9-91fb-b92978b21cdd",
                                "sense_id": "4ef34019-a642-3b51-9aac-323c2c74ba5e",
                                "text": "Hier multipliziere ich ein Googol mit 1 (jede Zahl mit Exponenten 0 ist gleich 1), das Ergebnis ist also ein Googol."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "81c8034f-6763-48f8-86ee-912f03dfe664",
                        "source_entry_id": "03cac131-1d4c-365f-9a15-d187443eefda",
                        "source_sense_id": "4ef34019-a642-3b51-9aac-323c2c74ba5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "古戈爾",
                        "target_lang_code": "zh",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6a4725ad-b29b-48d5-89b2-1a4f53e67b16",
                        "source_entry_id": "03cac131-1d4c-365f-9a15-d187443eefda",
                        "source_sense_id": "4ef34019-a642-3b51-9aac-323c2c74ba5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "googol",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "googol",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7d8f9da-7740-3bd0-92a5-5e5d38f57582",
                                        "entry_id": "9cc8133d-75f0-396d-97eb-f43395fc3b9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The number 10¹⁰⁰, or ten to the power of a hundred. Equivalent to ten duotrigintillion (short scale), or ten sexdecilliard (long scale)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3ca1fae-f65b-450d-a1c0-e4ae56522d3b",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d8f9da-7740-3bd0-92a5-5e5d38f57582",
                                                "text": "Words of wisdom are spoken by children at least as often as by scientists. The name \"googol\" was invented by a child (Dr. Kasner's nine-year-old nephew) who was asked to think up a name for a very big number, namely, 1 with a hundred zeros after it. He was very certain that this number was not infinite, and therefore equally certain that it had to have a name. […] A googolplex is much bigger than a googol, much bigger than a googol times a googol. A googol times a googol would be 1 with 200 zeros, whereas a googolplex is one with a googol of zeros. You will get some idea of the size of this very large but finite number from the fact that there would not be enough room to write it, if you went to the farthest star, touring all the nebulae and putting down zeros every inch of the way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "847dee6e-e1ba-4fa4-bdcd-993ea8761eab",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d8f9da-7740-3bd0-92a5-5e5d38f57582",
                                                "text": "For example, in considering all the finite state grammars that use seven terminal symbols and seven auxiliary symbols (states), [...] he must test over a googol (10^100) candidates."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73813a85-1bc2-4fb4-bdce-f58bf77ae8f1",
                                                "sense_id": "e7d8f9da-7740-3bd0-92a5-5e5d38f57582",
                                                "text": "If the universe were packed solid with neutrons, say, so there was no empty space anywhere, there would still only be about 10¹²⁸ particles in it, quite a bit more than a googol but trivially small compared to a googolplex."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb6f7555-badb-4113-9a17-51f4e2957235",
                        "source_entry_id": "03cac131-1d4c-365f-9a15-d187443eefda",
                        "source_sense_id": "4ef34019-a642-3b51-9aac-323c2c74ba5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "gogol",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gogol",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0f22549-aee6-3f97-9c74-9b66908a87c4",
                                        "entry_id": "edd21a7e-7712-3323-be90-b11076a8510c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "10¹⁰⁰, soit nombre entier dont la représentation décimale s’écrit avec le chiffre 1 suivi de 100 zéros."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33a7f6b4-be21-416e-a5ea-e4993873e190",
                                                "sense_id": "c0f22549-aee6-3f97-9c74-9b66908a87c4",
                                                "text": "Un gogol, équivaut à 10¹⁰⁰, soit 10 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000 000."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "gogol",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c2b617d-8f55-3eca-8ab8-08d0fca67e5c",
                                        "entry_id": "d18ac2aa-9369-31bc-be26-eb28136cb5ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sot ; demeuré ; imbécile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "offensive",
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21775185-0421-477c-9adf-740998127abb",
                                                "sense_id": "0c2b617d-8f55-3eca-8ab8-08d0fca67e5c",
                                                "text": "Le plus gogol des gogols trouve alors, avec intelligence, la bonne parade :\n— « M’sieur l'inspecteur, vous faisez le conseil avec nous ? »\nMonsieur l'Inspecteur n'a plus qu'à s'incliner devant cette démonstration de démocratie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47ff1c34-467b-4f9d-8214-43c6310ccfdf",
                                                "sense_id": "0c2b617d-8f55-3eca-8ab8-08d0fca67e5c",
                                                "text": "Et Olympe s'est retrouvée, avec les gogols, en classe de perfectionnement, puisqu'il s'agit du terme exact. Perfectionnement de quoi ? Nul ne sait. De la relégation, sans doute. Et du mépris dissimulé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02ef7a89-fc88-4866-b7f2-c6811c1b84c3",
                                                "sense_id": "0c2b617d-8f55-3eca-8ab8-08d0fca67e5c",
                                                "text": "Un ton trop enfantin ou le fait d'insister sur une consigne fait réagir aussi certains jeunes : « ça va, me parle pas comme à un gogol … Non mais c'est bon j'ai compris je suis pas débile » (Johan, 15 ans)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa030b64-852d-4b6c-bd26-054907c19851",
                                                "sense_id": "0c2b617d-8f55-3eca-8ab8-08d0fca67e5c",
                                                "text": "Je pense que le mot que j’ai entendu le plus jusqu’à mes quatorze ans est « gogol ». J’ai dû entendre dix mille fois les gens m’appeler gogol."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
